WHAT THIS COVERS

    The datasets released in this repository, namely:

    - `structures/`  the five DFT-confirmed generated candidate structures (CIF);
    - `data/structure_property_table.csv`  the processed structure-property
      dataset (effective anisotropy K_eff, magnetization, symmetry, and
      easy-axis labels for 2,762 entries);
    - `data/cv_splits/`  the fixed cross-validation splits used in this work.

